   103	validation (`validate` on `ubuntu-latest`) and relay work (`relay-toolchain` plus
   104	the Linux rows of `relay-portable-runtime`). This is observed implementation,
   105	not an architectural requirement. Every successor check required by the macOS
   106	working-client path must be runnable on the declared GitHub-hosted macOS image;
